# 🤖 AI Multi-Platform Content Automation with n8n

## Overview

An AI-powered content generation workflow built with n8n that transforms a topic and target audience into structured, platform-ready content.

The workflow can generate content for LinkedIn, Facebook and blogging platforms while using AI Agent instructions and additional processing nodes to refine and structure the output.

## 💼 Business Problem

Creating content for multiple platforms often requires repeatedly:

* Rewriting the same idea
* Adjusting tone and format
* Adding emojis and formatting
* Structuring long-form content
* Adapting content to different audiences
* Refining raw AI-generated responses

This workflow centralizes that process into one automated pipeline.

## ⚙️ Workflow Architecture

```text
Topic / Subject
       +
Target Audience
       ↓
   n8n Trigger
       ↓
    AI Agent
       ↓
System Instructions
       ↓
Content Generation
       ↓
Refinement / Processing Nodes
       ↓
Structured Output
       ↓
 ┌─────────┬──────────┬─────────┐
 ↓         ↓          ↓
LinkedIn  Facebook    Blog
```

