## 🧠 Why the System Prompt Matters

A generic AI prompt can produce generic content.

This workflow uses detailed system instructions to control factors such as:

* Audience
* Tone
* Structure
* Content requirements
* Formatting
* Output style
* Platform requirements

Additional workflow nodes then process and refine the raw AI response before it becomes the final output.

